        "filing_date": "2026-06-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To achieve a robust organizational and management foundation that combines high reproducibility and productivity, we are pursuing the following initiatives: “Establishing productivity-enhancing systems and a competitive human resource framework” and “Establishing an agile, trusted, and stable human resource operating structure.”",
